{"w":["2026-11-09","2026-11-15"],"built":"2026-11-09T03:02Z","pending":96,"N":["","Nature's Way NZ describes its Pea Protein powder as a \"low-allergen, vegan protein\".","Nature's Way NZ Acai Powder: \"Gluten free, dairy free, vegan, Non GMO, soy free.\"","Woolworths NZ pack claim lists \"Vegan\" for these turmeric tablets.","Nature's Way NZ Kale Powder: \"Vegan, gluten-free, dairy free and non GMO.\"","Kellogg's product page states \"Suitable for vegans\"; the NZ page lists the same ingredients.","Jed's FAQ: \"Yes, Jed's coffee is by nature suitable for vegetarians and vegans.\" No dairy ingredients added.","Barker's product page shows a Vegan dietary badge for this fruit tea syrup.","Woolworths NZ pack claim says \"Vegan friendly\"; dark choc ingredients list no dairy.","Blue Frog's product page for the porridge pockets says \"100% vegan\".","Remedy: \"Kombucha, Sodaly and Switchel are all vegan-friendly.\"","Majans NZ FAQ: \"Bhuja snacks are suitable for Vegans and Vegetarians\"; this mix carries a Vegan friendly badge.","Woolworths NZ pack claim: \"Vegan; USDA Organic\"; the coconut milk is plant milk.","Open Food Facts lists the Vegan label for Dolmio Extra Italian Herb pasta sauce.","Bluebird's NZ FAQ (maker of Copper Kettle) lists Copper Kettle Sea Salt as suitable for vegans.","Pepsi Max official FAQ: \"Yes, Pepsi MAX is suitable for both vegetarians and vegans.\"","Chelsea FAQ: nearly all its sugars and syrups suit vegans; the only exception is Honey Maple Flavoured Syrup.","Woolworths NZ pack claim says vegan, but emulsifier 471 (source unstated) is listed; check first.","Pringles' Minis BBQ product page states \"Suitable for vegans and vegetarians\".","Vitasoy's site lists Soy Milky Regular as suitable for vegetarians and vegans.","Lo Bros FAQ: \"Yes! We are 100% vegan.\" NZ Feijoa 330ml ingredients list no animal products.","Lo Bros FAQ: \"Yes! We are 100% vegan.\" NZ Ginger & Turmeric 330ml ingredients list no animal products.","PETA Australia's accidentally vegan list includes Sour Patch Kids.","PETA Australia's Accidentally Vegan list includes Sour Patch Kids under Lollies and Chocolate, with no flavour caveat.","Bluebird's NZ FAQ lists Bluebird Ready Salted (Originals, Thick Cut and Thinly Cut) as suitable for vegans.","Ceres Organics' product page lists the bar as \"Vegetarian, Vegan, Plant Based\" with a Vegan badge."],"S":["Woolworths label","Nature's Way (manufacturer)","Woolworths NZ listing (pack claim)","Kellogg's (manufacturer)","Jed's (manufacturer)","Barker's (manufacturer)","Blue Frog (manufacturer)","Remedy (manufacturer)","Majans (manufacturer)","Open Food Facts","Bluebird (manufacturer)","Pepsi Max (manufacturer)","Chelsea (manufacturer)","Pringles (manufacturer)","Vitasoy (manufacturer)","Lo Bros (manufacturer)","PETA Australia","Ceres Organics (manufacturer)"],"U":["","https://naturesway.co.nz/products/pea-protein-powder/","https://naturesway.co.nz/products/natures-way-acai-powder-75gm?variant=47804154282210","https://naturesway.co.nz/products/natures-way-kale-powder-120g","https://www.kelloggs.com.au/en_AU/products/just-right-original.html","https://www.jedscoffee.co.nz/contact/","https://barkers.co.nz/shop/feijoa-lime-500ml","https://bluefrogbreakfast.co.nz/products/vanilla-bean-chia-seed-porridge-copy-1","https://www.remedydrinks.com/blogs/news/are-remedy-drinks-vegan","https://majans.co.nz/bhuja/","https://world.openfoodfacts.org/product/9310012039556/dolmio-extra-pasta-sauce-italian-herb","https://www.bluebird.co.nz/faqs","https://www.pepsimax.com.au/faq","https://www.chelsea.co.nz/about-sugar/faqs/","https://www.pringles.com/au/products/multipack-minis/pringles-minis-BBQ-95g.html","https://soy.com.au/product/soy-milky-regular/","https://lobros.co/pages/got-questions","https://www.peta.org.au/living/accidentally-vegan/","https://ceres.co.nz/products/12925-cacao-fig-orange-raw-wholefood-bar-50g"],"r":[["6057513","Super Food Pea Protein","Nature's Way","375g",20.19,27.95,0,1,"","","p",1,1,1,